 of transactions and all of  these underlying fundamentals they're  really damn bullish  i hope that you guys enjoyed this  breakdown if you haven't already  subscribed to the blockwear newsletter  or follow will on twitter i highly  suggest you do both you can find links  to his twitter or to the newsletter in  the description below and we'll be back  next week with me and will both talking  about on chain metrics all the  derivatives and the macro environment  every friday and so i hope that you'll  join us then until then i'll see you  guys next week
 

